  "name": "Rocky Mountain Fur Con",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Rocky Mountain Fur Con (RMFC) was an annual furry convention in Denver, Colorado, held from 2007 to 2016. It was first chaired by Kahuki Lairu, with Sorin Kat as assistant chair and later chairman, and was held at the Adam's Mark Hotel, the Hyatt Regency, the Crowne Plaza, the DoubleTree and the Marriott Denver Tech Center as it grew. A charity casino night, begun for the 2013 \"Lucky 13!\" theme, became a regular event, and attendance grew from 236 to 1,677 in the final year. The 2017 convention, planned for August under the theme \"Carnival Nocturne\", was cancelled in April 2017.",
